# m6_fork: forks across hold-B rewinds. m2_play's input (the sweep with its holds at 2084 and
# 3320), the sweep carried on to 4399, plus a third hold-B at 4050..4064 that crosses a fork
# collection. Forks replay the ship's own trail 24 ticks per ghost behind and fire a level-1
# volley of the current weapon (M7) where the ship fired then; debug_history_check (0 = the
# world rebuilt from keyframe + input log is identical) is the point of the script.
# Re-pinned for M7: in god mode (debug_god at 31), since on this sweep a normal game dies in
# stage 1 and a probe game loses each fork to the next hit, so it never holds two.
# - 2065 (game tick 2035): fork 1 grabbed (forks 0 -> 1), F3. The 2084..2093 hold (20 ticks)
#   goes back past it: 2093 (tick 2033) forks 0; after the release the sweep runs 30 ticks
#   ahead and misses the crate.
# - 2402: the A crate swaps F3 for A3 (13); 2429 the retry shield (never used in god mode);
#   2660 an F crate swaps back (3). 3184 (tick 3123): a fork again (forks 1), F4 at 3278.
# - The 3320..3334 hold runs with the ghost and its bolts in flight: 3330 is a held frame
#   (state 5), 3335 the release (no tick), 3336 the first live tick. F5 at 3813.
# - 4043 (tick 3936): fork 2, two ghosts. B 4050..4064 (15 frames = 30 ticks, 3942 -> 3912):
#   4052 is back at tick 3936, forks 2; 4053 (tick 3934) is before the grab: forks 1. 4065 is
#   the release (PLAYING, no tick), 4066 the first live tick. The shifted sweep grabs the
#   same crate again at 4165 (tick 4012): forks 2, two ghosts to the end (4300: 34 bolts).
--frames 4400 --call-at "31 debug_god" --dump-exports debug_state,debug_weapon,debug_forks,debug_shield,debug_bolts,debug_rewinds --at "2064 debug_forks == 0" --at "2065 debug_forks == 1" --at "2084 debug_state == 5" --at "2092 debug_forks == 1" --at "2093 debug_forks == 0" --at "2093 debug_history_check == 0" --at "2094 debug_state == 1" --at "2094 debug_history_check == 0" --at "2095 debug_history_check == 0" --at "2402 debug_weapon == 13" --at "2700 debug_history_check == 0" --at "3183 debug_forks == 0" --at "3184 debug_forks == 1" --at "3278 debug_weapon == 4" --at "3300 debug_bolts > 10" --at "3300 debug_history_check == 0" --at "3330 debug_state == 5" --at "3330 debug_forks == 1" --at "3330 debug_history_check == 0" --at "3335 debug_state == 1" --at "3335 debug_history_check == 0" --at "3336 debug_history_check == 0" --at "3813 debug_weapon == 5" --at "4042 debug_forks == 1" --at "4043 debug_forks == 2" --at "4049 debug_history_check == 0" --at "4050 debug_state == 5" --at "4052 debug_forks == 2" --at "4053 debug_forks == 1" --at "4053 debug_history_check == 0" --at "4064 debug_state == 5" --at "4064 debug_game_tick == 3912" --at "4064 debug_history_check == 0" --at "4065 debug_state == 1" --at "4065 debug_forks == 1" --at "4065 debug_history_check == 0" --at "4066 debug_history_check == 0" --at "4164 debug_forks == 1" --at "4165 debug_forks == 2" --at "4300 debug_bolts > 20" --at "4300 debug_history_check == 0" --at "4399 debug_history_check == 0" --expect "debug_state == 1" --expect "debug_forks == 2" --expect "debug_rewinds == 3"
